minali."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In Marseilles a skilled pizza delivery boy Daniel who drives a scooter finally has his dreams come true. He gets a taxi license. Caught by the police for a huge speed infraction, he will help Emilien, a loser inspector who can't drive, on the track of German bank robbers, so he doesn't lose his license and his dream job."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Daniel est un fou du volant. Cet ex-livreur de pizzas est aujourd'hui chauffeur de taxi et sait échapper aux radars les plus perfectionnés. Pourtant, un jour, il croise la route d'Emilien, policier recalé pour la huitième fois à son permis de conduire. Pour conserver son taxi, il accepte le marché que lui propose Emilien : l'aider à démanteler un gang de braqueurs de banques qui écume les succursales de la ville à bord de puissants véhicules. Road-movie urbain sur un scénario de Luc Besson, également producteur."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yseZTLeVv56MD5fLlbpfF1MNOaA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nmGgqRzbb0OHJloknzlorUzUVQo.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2330,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yseZTLeVv56MD5fLlbpfF1MNOaA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yseZTLeVv56MD5fLlbpfF1MNOaA.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yseZTLeVv56MD5fLlbpfF1MNOaA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yseZTLeVv56MD5fLlbpfF1MNOaA.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/egBxj3ude84theXc3cLbBHrWOkQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/egBxj3ude84theXc3cLbBHrWOkQ.jpg","language":"en"